OL,3,GNEWSAUnchipped cat crisis 'out of
OL,4,Acontrol' in resort
OL,5,
OL,6,FA huge number of cats not being
OL,7,Fmicrochipped is a "major problem" at
OL,8,F"epidemic levels", animal charity
OL,9,Fworkers have said.
OL,11,FJoan Lamb, a cat rescuer and volunteer
OL,12,Ffor animal reuniting charity Harvey's
OL,13,FArmy, said many stray cats in Blackpool
OL,14,Fcould not be linked to owners and had
OL,15,Fnot been neutered or spayed either.
OL,17,FShe said the law requiring all cats in
OL,18,FEngland to be registered on a database
OL,19,Fwas not being enforced.
